<title>PHILIPPINES: San Miguel declares 0.20 peso cash div.</title>
<headline>San Miguel declares 0.20 peso cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beer and food firm San Miguel Corp said on Friday it declared a cash dividend of 0.20 peso to shareholders on record as of September 20, 1996.</p>
<p>The dividends will be payable on October 18, 1996.</p>
<p>San Miguel pays quarterly dividends.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
